{"headword":"שָׂשׂוֹן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.3\">Is 51:3</a></sup> <strong>exultation, rejoicing</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:8\" href=\"/Psalms.45.8\">ψ 45:8</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂשׂן</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:16\" href=\"/Esther.8.16\">Est 8:16</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂשׂוֹן</span> (Sta <sup>§ 296 e</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:14\" href=\"/Psalms.51.14\">ψ 51:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:111\" href=\"/Psalms.119.111\">119:111</a>;—<em>exultation, joy</em> (especially in <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s favour), <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:12\" href=\"/Joel.1.12\">Jo 1:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 12:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.12.3\">Is 12:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:14\" href=\"/Psalms.51.14\">ψ 51:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:43\" href=\"/Psalms.105.43\">105:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:111\" href=\"/Psalms.119.111\">119:111</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁמֶן שׂ׳</span> (i.e. with which guests were anointed; fig.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:8\" href=\"/Psalms.45.8\">ψ 45:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">Is 61:3</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁם שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.9\">Je 33:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהִלָּה</span>; on text v. Gie Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 115</sup>); elsewhere ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחָה</span>: <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.34\">Je 7:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.16\">15:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.9\">16:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.10\">25:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.11\">33:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.13\">Is 22:13</a> (only here condemned as reckless, wanton), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.10\">35:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.3\">51:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:19\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.19\">Zc 8:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:10\" href=\"/Psalms.51.10\">ψ 51:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:16\" href=\"/Esther.8.16\">Est 8:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:17\" href=\"/Esther.8.17\">17</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂמַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.13\">Je 31:13</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵבֶל</span>)."}]},"rid":"BDB09648","strong_numbers":["8342"],"next_hw":"מָשׂוֹשׂ²","prev_hw":"שׂוּשׂ","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8607"],"TWOT":["2246a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}